	(text "Ferrite Bead Calculations\n\nImax = In6 + Iov + Isd + Ids + Irf (mA)\n= 400 + 120 + 200 + 250 + 350 =~ 1.32 A\n\nIrated = 2.5(Imax) = 3.3 A\n\nVdrop should be no greater than 40mV. \n\nDCR = 40mV / Imax =  30m\n\n\n\n"
